"P2145705610" "Alan Desslock"
// ProfessionString :
"P3323921359" "Ex-Arachnos Soldier"
// DescriptionString :
"P3979062950" "Alan was once a high ranking Arachnos soldier. On one mission, his superiors ordered him into a suicide scenario, unbeknownst to him and his team. Being a diversion, his superiors did not do anything about his team's safety and they were wiped out, with Desslock being the only survivor. He made his way out of the nightmare and back to the Rogue Isles where he quit Arachnos and now does what he can to subvert their activities, all the while looking to place an operative on the inside."
// HelloString :
"P4160567279" "Yeah?"
// HelloString :
"P542885946" "What?"
// HelloString :
"P3673355685" "Hurmph."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2028478334" "Beat it before I beat you."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3210238234" "So you're the one who is tired of all these 'Destined Ones', eh? Well, maybe we can work together and do something about it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1838385707" "You and me, we've got nothing more to do with one another."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2317327137" "I'd love to work with you, but you look like you are already indebted to too many other people at this time."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3988503365" "I don't have anything for you right now, but come back when you are Threat Level {Level} and we can talk some more."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4050455993" "I understand how awesome you THINK you are, if you want I can put you into your place."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1830387476" "Well, look at that, the insignificant one actually has some potential."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P778484191" "Players should never see this"
// LocationString :
"P2613846116" "Mercy Island"
// IntroString :
"P3958075051" "string"
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1532309892" "Let me introduce you to a friend of mine."
