"P4110191946" "Fortunata Hamilton"
// ProfessionString :
"P2462174386" "Fortunata Hamilton and Alan Desslock go way back, back to his soldiering days. Some say that she still helps him out of pity for what Arachnos did to him, but others think there is a deeper connection between the two. It's either that or Alan has some dirt on her that she would rather be kept private."
