// FirstVisitString :
"P418609969" "{HeroName}, if I am not mistaken."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2695479335" "Our time together has come to an end."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2669407913" "Your fate needs attending to, but you must first finish up some other tasks in this timeline."
