"P753883263" "Fate is fickle, but I can hold her back."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2913218038" "You must seek your fate elsewhere, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
"P3345659944" "Port Oakes"
// IntroString :
"P3651575955" "Forunata Hamilton is the one you need to seek. She and Alan have a deal, she won't give him up to Arachnos, and he won't clue them in on her dirty little secret."
